<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Healing Gel</ansi> mutation

Your pores secrete a thick, regenerative gel when you concentrate. It
knits wounds with remarkable speed but leaves you coated in a viscous
residue that slows your movements. Even at rest, you heal slightly
faster than normal.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Active Ability
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Active ability: secrete a burst of healing gel to rapidly mend
  your wounds
  Slightly faster passive health regeneration even when not
  actively using the ability

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Slightly slower stamina recovery — the constant secretion taxes
  your body's resources

